  "details": "Notifications when entering instances are offset to the left on mobile. This is inconsistent with desktop where they are in the center. This is a thing both in portrait and landscape mode.\n\nIt would also make sense to move up the notification since it's covered by the on screen joystick in portrait mode. And it's a bit hard to notice it when it's so far down.",
